@startuml
title 7. Generación de borrador sin LLM

actor Inspector
participant Frontend
participant "Report Draft API\nPOST /api/v1/report-drafts/generate/{inspection_id}" as ReportDraftRoute
participant "reportdraftservice.generatereportdraft" as DraftService
participant "reportdraftservice.rendertemplate" as TemplateRenderer
participant "reportstatusservice.registerreportevent" as StatusEvents
database DB

Inspector -> Frontend: Solicita borrador automático sin LLM
Frontend -> ReportDraftRoute: POST /api/v1/report-drafts/generate/{inspection_id}\nReportDraftGenerateRequest
ReportDraftRoute -> DraftService: generatereportdraft(db,\ninspection_id, templateversion)

DraftService -> DB: Cargar Inspection + fields + evidences
DB --> DraftService: Datos de inspección
DraftService -> DB: Cargar Transcription(s)
DB --> DraftService: Transcripciones

DraftService -> TemplateRenderer: rendertemplate(inspection,\ntranscriptions, templateversion)
TemplateRenderer --> DraftService: generatedtext, snapshot

DraftService -> DB: INSERT ReportDraft(\ninspection_id, title,\ntemplateversion,\nstatus="generated",\ngeneratedtext,\nsourcesnapshot,\ngenerationtimems,\nlastaction="draftgenerated")
DraftService -> StatusEvents: registerreportevent(...,\naction="draftcreated")
DraftService -> StatusEvents: registerreportevent(...,\naction="draftgenerated")
DB --> DraftService: Draft persistido

DraftService --> ReportDraftRoute: ReportDraft
ReportDraftRoute --> Frontend: 201 ReportDraftResponse
Frontend --> Inspector: Muestra borrador generado

@enduml